  "text": "### 3. Account Balance Issues  \n**Example:** Missing credit, wrong balance shown, interest miscalculated  \n**Investigation:**\n- Reconcile transactions\n- Check system records\n- Verify calculations\n- Review any hold periods  \n**Resolution:**\n- If bank error: Correct balance + interest on missing amount\n- If customer misunderstanding: Explain (educate, don't penalize)\n- If system error: Urgent IT escalation to fix",
